  64:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_spi.c ****        Master Receive mode restriction:
  65:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_spi.c ****       (#) In Master unidirectional receive-only mode (MSTR =1, BIDIMODE=0, RXONLY=1) or
  66:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_spi.c ****           bidirectional receive mode (MSTR=1, BIDIMODE=1, BIDIOE=0), to ensure that the SPI
